{"type":"text","timestamp":1790381432604,"sessionID":"ses_f24f833e1ffes8bsZD9nB8px05","part":{"id":"prt_0db0c9ef2001K5abKkDPMfpIAf","messageID":"msg_0db0c72ab00125Q1BQLfhoLCfM","sessionID":"ses_f24f833e1ffes8bsZD9nB8px05","type":"text","text":"The project loads cleanly and the captured frames render as expected for this intentionally geometry-free scene. I’m adding a temporary runtime harness outside the project to invoke `fire_weapon()` and assert the emitted direction/power and resulting PlayerBody camera displacement through the serialized scene connection.","time":{"start":1790381432562,"end":1790381432567},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_03a51402348eacea016ab70d773eac87d09a4cce8eef6ddf9e","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790381432604,"sessionID":"ses_f24f833e1ffes8bsZD9nB8px05","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_9Oe7RKJQu9pnsiyXbMZYV6YQ","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /tmp/opencode/verify_weapon_impulse.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+    var main := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+    root.add_child(main)\n+\n+    var weapon := main.get_node(\"WeaponEffects\")\n+    var player := main.get_node(\"PlayerBody\")\n+    var expected_direction: Vector3 = -weapon.barrel_ray_cast.global_basis.z.normalized()\n+    var emitted_direction := Vector3.ZERO\n+    var emitted_power := 0.0\n+\n+    weapon.on_shot_camera_impulse.connect(func(direction: Vector3, power: float) -> void:\n+        emitted_direction = direction\n+        emitted_power = power\n+    )\n+    weapon.fire_weapon()\n+\n+    assert(emitted_direction.is_equal_approx(expected_direction))\n+    assert(is_equal_approx(emitted_direction.length(), 1.0))\n+    assert(is_equal_approx(emitted_power, 0.3))\n+    assert(player.camera_shake_position.length() > 0.0)\n+    assert(player.camera_shake_position.z < 0.0)\n+    print(\"Weapon impulse verified: direction=\", emitted_direction, \", power=\", emitted_power, \", camera_offset=\", player.camera_shake_position)\n+    quit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tmp/opencode/verify_weapon_impulse.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /tmp/opencode/verify_weapon_impulse.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /tmp/opencode/verify_weapon_impulse.gd\n+++ /tmp/opencode/verify_weapon_impulse.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+    var main := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+    root.add_child(main)\n+\n+    var weapon := main.get_node(\"WeaponEffects\")\n+    var player := main.get_node(\"PlayerBody\")\n+    var expected_directi