{"type":"text","timestamp":1790381527354,"sessionID":"ses_f24f833e1ffes8bsZD9nB8px05","part":{"id":"prt_0db0e11200015gAT1o3bDgOdAL","messageID":"msg_0db0d6758001dcXLp0zV4VzByR","sessionID":"ses_f24f833e1ffes8bsZD9nB8px05","type":"text","text":"Implemented the complete weapon recoil signal flow:\n\n- `scripts/weapon_effects.gd`\n  - Added typed `on_shot_camera_impulse(Vector3, float)` signal.\n  - Added exported `camera_shake_power` defaulting to `0.3`.\n  - `fire_weapon()` now emits the normalized global forward direction from `BarrelRayCast` with the exported power.\n\n- `scenes/weapon_rig.tscn`\n  - Exposes `BarrelEnd`, `BarrelRayCast`, and `camera_shake_power = 0.3`.\n\n- `scripts/player_body.gd`\n  - Added `apply_weapon_impulse()`, forwarding to `impulse_camera_with_recoil()`.\n\n- `scenes/main.tscn`\n  - Connected the weapon signal to `PlayerBody.apply_weapon_impulse`.\n\nValidated with Godot 4.4.1:\n\n- Project and scenes load without script or scene errors.\n- Visual smoke-test frames rendered successfully.\n- Runtime assertion confirmed direction `(0, 0, -1)`, power `0.3`, and immediate camera offset `(0, 0.12, -0.09)`.","time":{"start":1790381527328,"end":1790381527331},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_03a51402348eacea016ab70db3cd9887d0a2aa85ec532a4088","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
